  "description": "Tackle hills and trails with the Nishiki Otero Integrated Electric Mountain Bike. This adult bike comes complete with a 500-watt rear hub motor and 48V lithium battery to power-up your rides. Utilize the pedal assist function to give the extra force needed to defeat slopes, or turn on the throttle to go up to 20 mph. Through superior construction and premium components, the Nishiki Otero is the choice for your next trail-ride.\n\nFEATURES:\n\n500-watt rear hub motor and 48V lithium battery combine to power Pedal Assist e-Bike with throttle up to 20mph\n\nEasy-to-read LED display\n\nBattery-level display\n\nBattery-lock security\n\nLightweight and durable aluminum frame\n\nS Ride 1x9 Shifting System\n\nFront and rear disc breaks\n\nFront light\n\nFront wheel QR hub\n\nHandlebar bell\n\nPadded vinyl saddle material\n\nACT Lab certified to UL 2849\n\nAs a commitment to the safety of our riders, Nishiki E-bikes are tested to the UL 2849 standard. This standard, specifically developed for E-bikes, ensures the battery, motor, controller, and charger follow rigorous testing as individual components and as component groups for products. Only when all components properly work together does the system pass the UL 2849 standard test. We believe these steps are an important investment within our total E-bike testing requirements.",
